  "releaseNotes": "Technical changes in 1.3.0: added async members to IDBRepositoryReadOnly/IDBRepository (GetByIdAsync, GetAllAsync, GetByFilterAsync, CountAsync, GetMaxAsync, GetMinAsync, MarkAsDeletedAsync) alongside the existing sync API; added UpdateAsync/DeleteAsync to ILookUpRepository/ILookUpBufferRepository alongside the existing sync API. Additive only, no breaking changes for consumers using the framework's base repository classes (direct external implementers of ILookUpRepository/ILookUpBufferRepository will need to implement the two new members).",
